/v1/","context":{"app_id":3943730,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-3943730","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T08:16:36Z","value":3,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5222640","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3943730-1847286114036121","game_id":"steam-3943730","kind":"announcement","title":"Dev Log 08: The Lexing Kite","summary":"\"Beneath a clear, star-filled sky, the dormant comet Haijiao Tianya reflects the light of the binary stars. Across the silent wilderness, the Lexing Kite shines brilliantly…\"Equipment OverviewThe \"Lexing Kite\", officially known as the INSIGNE Battle Robe, bears the full designation INSIGNE · Chengfeng Suoli and is also known as the Starwalker’s Mantle. It is an adaptive exoskeletal system used by the Pioneer during interstellar exploration, engineering operations, and missions in extreme environ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T12:05:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114036121","verified_at":"2026-10-23T12:09:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3943730-1846651706684298","game_id":"steam-3943730","kind":"update","title":"DEMO Update","summary":"Since the demo launched, we've received a lot of valuable feedback from players about exploration, progression guidance, visuals, gameplay systems, and more.Based on your feedback and our development plans, we've made a number of improvements and updates. In particular, we've made significant adjustments to the content selected for this demo, hoping to provide a better preview of the full game experience.GeneralAdjusted the starting location.Added new guidance for basic controls, resource gather","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T10:48:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706684298","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3943730-1846018067933075","game_id":"steam-3943730","kind":"announcement","title":"Dev Blog 07: From Stars to Comets — The Science Behind Our ³He Mining System","summary":"IntroductionDeep within the star system of Huntian: StarTrace lies a comet known as Haijiao Tianya. Stretching nearly 30 kilometers from end to end, it is a dormant, frozen body with neither a coma nor a tail, drifting quietly through the stellar winds of a binary star system. But look closely into the fractures running across its exposed rocky surface, and you may find something far more valuable: ³He — helium-3.In the real world, helium-3 has long been discussed as one of the most promising fu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T12:00:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067933075","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3943730-1845383656376995","game_id":"steam-3943730","kind":"announcement","title":"Dev Blog 06: Planetary Control Module — The Science Behind World Transformation","summary":"The Planetary Control Module is one of the core concepts in Huntian: StarTrace. It was an invention created by an inventor during the Galactic Age.In today’s dev blog, we would like to take a closer look at how this invention might actually work.I. Core ConceptWhat is the Planetary Control Module?The Planetary Control Module is not a conventional device for controlling a planet’s environment. Instead, it is a spacetime control system capable of measuring, locating, anchoring, and reconstructing ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T10:01:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656376995","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3943730-1845383656376363","game_id":"steam-3943730","kind":"announcement","title":"Huntian: StarTrace Demo Play Guide","summary":"— Welcome to LexingThank you for playing the Huntian: StarTrace Demo!This Demo is a work-in-progress version of the game. We hope you enjoy your time on Lexing. If you encounter any problems during your experience, or have any thoughts, feelings, or suggestions about Lexing, please feel free to let us know. We will take them seriously and continue improving the game based on the feedbacks you share with us.A strange planet may call for some guidance. Of course, we also know that many people pref","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T05:30:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656376363","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3943730-1844751498227109","game_id":"steam-3943730","kind":"announcement","title":"3 Days to Demo — Lexing Emerges","summary":"Dear Pioneers,We’re thrilled to share some exciting news with you—On September 29, the Demo for Huntian: StarTrace will be available on Steam.-This time, we’re inviting you to truly set foot on Lexing.Put on your jetpack and soar across Lexing’s wild landscapes and valleys. Mine for resources, journey across the desert, and search for scattered civilization fragments as you work to restore humanity’s lost technology. And perhaps, you’ll pass through a wormhole and experience entirely different g","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-26T12:15:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498227109","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3943730-1844751498220519","game_id":"steam-3943730","kind":"announcement","title":"Dev Blog 05: From Worshipping the Moon to Creating One","summary":"Mid-Autumn Festival Is Almost HereFor many people, the Mid-Autumn Festival is a familiar part of the year. On this day, people gather with their families, admire the Moon, and send their best wishes to those who are far away. Over the centuries, the Moon, family reunion, homeland, and longing for distant loved ones have gradually become some of the most enduring associations with the festival.Yet before it became a festival, the Mid-Autumn tradition was, in many ways, an act of looking up at the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-24T07:31:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498220519","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3943730-1844115010494502","game_id":"steam-3943730","kind":"announcement","title":"Dev Blog04: Civilization Legacy — The History Behind Our Civilization Fragment","summary":"When the end of the world comes, what would be worth preserving aboard the Arkship?In our previous Dev Blog, we talked about how we divided the history of human civilization into sixteen distinct eras.EraPeriodCore FeatureDescriptionChaosPrehistoryInstinctive ObservationHumanity’s understanding of the universe was still at an instinctive stage, dating back to early humans.Knotted RecordsAround 30,000 BCE – 3000 BCEPhysical RecordsHumans began consciously using knots, carvings, arranged stones, a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-18T11:30:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010494502","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3943730-1843481262694299","game_id":"steam-3943730","kind":"announcement","title":"Dev Log03: Tracing Humanity’s Journey — The History Before Lexing","summary":"“Those who gaze into the stars will one day become part of them.—And at the end of the stars, another journey begins.”Prologue · A History of Looking to the StarsBefore writing a fictional epic among the stars, we first turn our eyes toward humanity’s real journey.Here, we do not trace history through the rise and fall of dynasties, nor measure civilization simply by dates and eras. Instead, we follow each transformation in humanity’s understanding of the sky, retracing the path civilization has","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-11T07:30:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262694299","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3943730-1842846814446027","game_id":"steam-3943730","kind":"announcement","title":"Dev Blog02: Building the Tech Tree — The Science Behind Our Energy Branch","summary":"In our previous dev blog, we started with the H–R diagram and worked our way to the fireball storm, gradually piecing together the sky of Lexing. But the sky is only the stage. What truly gives players something to do beneath that sky is the path under their feet——a journey from the most primitive forms of survival all the way to controlled nuclear fusion.That path is the tech tree.The Smallest Unit of the Tech TreeThe smallest unit of our tech tree is the tech node. Each tech node contains a na","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T10:35:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814446027","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3943730-1841579228677811","game_id":"steam-3943730","kind":"announcement","title":"Dev Blog01: Building the Sky of Lexing","summary":"The Fall — and the BeginningThe story begins with an interstellar fall.While searching for a new home aboard the Arkship, we unexpectedly crash-land in an uncharted region of space. The various devices carrying humanity’s knowledge and technologies are scattered across the wilderness, strewn beneath the light of a binary star.This star system consists of a K-type red giant and a blue-white F-type main-sequence star. In orbit around the system’s eighth planet, the Arkship and its colossal ring-sh","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-25T09:58:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228677811","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:14:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3943730-1841579228675562","game_id":"steam-3943730","kind":"announcement","title":"A letter to Home","summary":"Hello, friends!It’s hard to believe how much time has passed since we last met. Last summer, we released our first trailer with you, and were lucky enough to receive so much support, feedback, and encouragement. For a young team just getting started, that was an incredibly valuable gift. Since then, we’ve been trying new ideas, experimenting with different approaches, and continuously refining and developing new content.Today, we’d like to share some of what we’ve been up to.First, we’ve continu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-24T13:33:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/extern